#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32G4 Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32G4 series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (G431, G441, G471, G473, G474, G483, G484, G491, G4A1)
